===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[mizzen]][[mast]]}}

# {{nautical}} The third [[mast]] from the [[bow]] on a ship having three or more masts
# {{nautical}} The [[shorter]], [[after]] mast of a ship having two masts, such as a [[ketch]] or [[yawl]]

